<title>SINGAPORE: India tenders to buy 25,000T of Jan 16-31 gasoline.</title>
<headline>India tenders to buy 25,000T of Jan 16-31 gasoline.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-owned Indian Oil Corp (IOC) has issued a tender to buy 25,000 tonnes of 87-octane leaded gasoline for delivery January 16-31 to Kandla or Goa on the west coast, industry sources said on Friday.</p>
<p>The tender closes January 9, and is valid until January 10.</p>
<p>IOC's last gasoline purchase, for January 1-15 delivery, was won by a western trader at $3.60 per barrel over Singapore 92-octane spot quotes, on a cost-and-freight basis.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-8703086)</p>
